	(text "NOTE\n* With JUMPER JP1 bridged, output current is variable causing \"breathing LED\" effect.\n* C1 and R5 values affect breathing effect\n\n* With JUMPER JP1 open, and resistors R4/R6 populated, the 555 works as a classic astable multivibrator\n* Output voltage switches between 2/3rd and 1/3rd of input voltage (6V)\n* C1/R4/R6 values affect astable frequency"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
